$ jailops app export off
! busy: jail "off" is not running
! hint: start it first: jailops start off; the draft reads the sockets the app listens on
[exit 5]

$ jailops app export missing
! not_found: jail "missing" not found
! hint: List the kind to see the names, check --host and --remote, and check the spelling. (jailops explain not_found)
[exit 4]

$ jailops app export
! usage: accepts 1 arg(s), received 0
! hint: run 'jailops app export --help' for usage
[exit 2]

